parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 10\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 24,787 / 270,000 used (9%)\n- Agent Age: 10 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'PBAGC-alpha0.9: Stronger Procrustes Alignment on PCA' (ID: 7) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.4935902409635907\n**ASW_batch:** 0.444\n**ASW_label:** 0.173\n**ARI:** 0.366\n**NMI:** 0.566\n**Graph_conn:** 0.835\n**kBET:** 0.733\n**iLISI:** 0.037\n**cLISI:** 0.942\n**PCR:** 0.602\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.238\n**Evaluation Details:** Human\
    \ Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.444  ASW_label: 0.173  ARI: 0.366  NMI: 0.566\n  Graph_conn: 0.835  kBET: 0.733  iLISI: 0.037  cLISI: 0.942\n  PCR: 0.602  Cell_cycle: 0.238\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.733631  ASW_label: 0.511349  ARI: 0.365489  NMI: 0.566578\n  Graph_conn: 0.837600  kBET: 0.700532  iLISI: 0.036971  cLISI: 0.982973\n  PCR: 0.601958  Cell_cycle: 0.212166\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/7ff15299-b019-4b58-bffe-9696b6986aa7/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 7ff15299-b019-4b58-bffe-9696b6986aa7\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission\
    \ 'PBAGC-BalancedGraph: Procrustes Embedding + Batch-Balanced kNN' (ID: 8) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5885051146069972\n**ASW_batch:** 0.468\n**ASW_label:** 0.180\n**ARI:** 0.540\n**NMI:** 0.522\n**Graph_conn:** 0.853\n**kBET:** 0.734\n**iLISI:** 0.903\n**cLISI:** 0.891\n**PCR:** 0.548\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.246\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.468  ASW_label: 0.180  ARI: 0.540  NMI: 0.522\n  Graph_conn: 0.853  kBET: 0.734  iLISI: 0.903  cLISI: 0.891\n  PCR: 0.548  Cell_cycle: 0.246\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.744203  ASW_label: 0.515718  ARI: 0.539508  NMI: 0.522413\n  Graph_conn: 0.855910  kBET: 0.701212  iLISI: 0.902754  cLISI: 0.968358\n  PCR: 0.547968  Cell_cycle: 0.218411\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn,\
