    | 89 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.76: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 40 | 0.7028 | 0.725 | 0.637 | 0.223 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.692 | 0.936 | 0.967 | 0.938 | 0.624 |\n| 94 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-45-noalign-resid0.74-l2_0.0005: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced... | Praxis I | 42 | 0.7027 | 0.724 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.692 | 0.925 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.635 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not\
