    \ 0.929 | cLISI 0.964 | PCR 0.938 | Cell_cycle 0.290\n    Note: Slight overall gain vs PC50; Graph_conn dropped at k=42 (likely needs k=45 to restore).\n  Running:\n  - EID 138: BRBG-Dual (ComBat PCA64 embedding + residualized-PC BalancedGraph k=42).\n  - EID 139: BRBG-Dual-k45 (same + k=45).\n  Goal: exceed 0.7090 by combining ComBat ARI gains with BRBG mixing/connectivity.\n```"
