    \ ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return dual_output_brbg(\n          adata,\n          n_pcs_emb=50,\n          n_pcs_graph=50,\n          gamma=0.75,\n          l2=1e-3,\n          k_total=48,\n          metric='cosine'\n      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"BRBG-Dual-gamma0.74-k48: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (γ=0.74, k=48)\"\ntags: \"dual-output, combat, residualization, balanced-knn, cosine\"\nabstract: \"Keep the best dual structure (ComBat PCA64 embedding + BalancedGraph k=48) but reduce residualization to γ=0.74 to test if lighter shrinkage improves biological metrics (ARI/NMI) without hurting batch mixing. Goal: exceed 0.7144.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from brbg_dual_comb_resid_graph import dual_output_brbg\n  import anndata as ad\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return dual_output_brbg(\n          adata,\n          n_pcs_emb=64,\n      \
    \    n_pcs_graph=50,\n          gamma=0.74,\n          l2=1e-3,\n          k_total=48,\n          metric='cosine'\n      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/research_log.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Praxis Lineage Research Log (Update)\n  Dual-output BRBG results:\n  - EID 138 (ComBat PCA64 + BRBG k=42): 0.7113\n  - EID 139 (ComBat PCA64 + BRBG k=45): 0.7118\n  - EID 141 (ComBat PCA64 + BRBG k=48): 0.7144 (new SOTA)\n    Notes: Relative to k=45, k=48 modestly improved composite; ARI ~0.713, ASW_batch ~0.703, Graph_conn ~0.966.\n  Running:\n  - BRBG-Dual-PCA50-k48: test embedding PCs=50 at k=48 (γ=0.75).\n  - BRBG-Dual-gamma0.74-k48: reduce shrinkage to γ=0.74 at k=48 (PCA64 embedding) to probe ARI/NMI trade-off.\n  Objective: verify plateau region and seek small gains beyond 0.7144 while keeping method parsimonious. Will record EIDs and update archive.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  SOTA Update (Tick 74):\n  - New\
