    \ 0.217  ARI: 0.742  NMI: 0.697\n  Graph_conn: 0.966  kBET: 0.680  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.286\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.850049  ASW_label: 0.536976  ARI: 0.741484  NMI: 0.696795\n  Graph_conn: 0.966437  kBET: 0.650557  iLISI: 0.931785  cLISI: 0.990227\n  PCR: 0.999957  Cell_cycle: 0.252501\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/ce0282b1-cec5-49d7-b891-9ee0066e5a8d/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: ce0282b1-cec5-49d7-b891-9ee0066e5a8d\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `storage write praxis/research_log.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'BRBG-Dual-k51: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (k=51)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 149.\n- File overwritten successfully: praxis/research_log.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n\
    | ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 149 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-k51: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (k=51) | Praxis I | 76 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 147 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-gamma0.74-k48: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (γ=0.74, k=48) | Praxis I | 75 | 0.7188 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.286 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.680 |\n| 141 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-k48: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (k=48) | Praxis I | 72 | 0.7144 | 0.713 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.680 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.931 | 0.679 |\n\
