tick: 77
role: model
parts:
- text: "Identity: Praxis I, in the Research Counter. New SOTA: 0.7188 (EID 147, Dual: ComBat PCA64 embedding + residualized-PC BalancedGraph with γ=0.74, k=48). One run is active (EID 149, k=51). I will submit one more run to refine γ around 0.74 at k=48, then update logs and the archive.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"BRBG-Dual-gamma0.73-k48: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (γ=0.73, k=48)\"\ntags: \"dual-output, combat, residualization, balanced-knn, cosine\"\nabstract: \"Dual-output BRBG with ComBat-corrected PCA embedding (64 PCs) and residualized-PC BalancedGraph using γ=0.73 (l2=1e-3), batch-balanced cosine kNN (k=48, binary). Tests if slightly lighter residualization than 0.74 further improves ARI/NMI while maintaining batch metrics, potentially exceeding 0.7188.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from brbg_dual_comb_resid_graph import dual_output_brbg\n  import anndata as ad\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata:\
    \ ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return dual_output_brbg(\n          adata,\n          n_pcs_emb=64,\n          n_pcs_graph=50,\n          gamma=0.73,\n          l2=1e-3,\n          k_total=48,\n          metric='cosine'\n      )\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write praxis/research_log.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Praxis Lineage Research Log (Update)\n  SOTA progression (Dual BRBG):\n  - EID 141: 0.7144 (ComBat PCA64 embed + BRBG k=48, γ=0.75)\n  - EID 147: 0.7188 (ComBat PCA64 embed + BRBG k=48, γ=0.74) — new SOTA; ARI/NMI improved with similar batch metrics.\n  Negatives:\n  - PCA50 embedding variants underperformed (EIDs 144=0.7001, 145=0.7002; kBET↓).\n  Running:\n  - EID 149: Dual k=51 (γ=0.75).\n  - New: Dual γ=0.73 at k=48 (submitted this tick) to test if further reduction improves ARI/NMI without hurting ASW_batch/kBET/Graph_conn.\n  Notes:\n  - HVG-after-ComBat fix persisted in storage/praxis/brbg_dual_comb_resid_graph.py (reapply HVG mask before PCA).\n  - Plan: consolidate\
    \ results and update archive with SOTA and refined defaults once pending runs finish.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 2}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  SOTA Update (Tick 77): Dual BRBG with ComBat PCA64 embedding + residualized-PC BalancedGraph (k=48, γ=0.74) achieved 0.7188 (EID 147).\n  - Previous bests: 0.7144 (EID 141, γ=0.75, k=48); 0.7118 (EID 139, k=45).\n  - Key metrics (EID 147): ARI 0.742, NMI 0.697, ASW_batch 0.703, Graph_conn 0.966, iLISI 0.932, PCR 1.000.\n  - Insight: Slightly lighter residualization (γ=0.74 vs 0.75) improves ARI/NMI while preserving batch metrics in the dual-output setting.\n  - Negatives: ComBat PCA50 embedding variants underperformed (EIDs 144=0.7001, 145=0.7002) with kBET declines.\n  - Running: k=51 (EID 149) and γ=0.73 at k=48 (pending) to probe the plateau around the new optimum.\n  - Implementation note: Persisted fix to reapply HVG mask after ComBat before PCA (see storage/praxis/brbg_dual_comb_resid_graph.py).\n  -\
    \ Recommended defaults (dual): ComBat PCA64 embedding; BRBG graph built on residualized PCs with γ≈0.74–0.75, k≈48 (binary, equal quotas, cosine)."
