    \ | Aether I | 69 | 0.7072 | 0.726 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.977 | 0.692 | 0.931 | 0.968 | 0.941 | 0.673 |\n| 131 | 1 | BRBG-PC64: Residualized PCA(64) + Balanced Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 68 | 0.7072 | 0.721 | 0.670 | 0.219 | 0.290 | 0.947 | 0.685 | 0.938 | 0.964 | 0.929 | 0.710 |\n| 135 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - N_Neighbors_Total 42 | Sophia I | 68 | 0.7072 | 0.726 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.977 | 0.692 | 0.931 | 0.968 | 0.941 | 0.672 |\n| 100 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-42-noalign-resid0.75: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 45 | 0.7071 | 0.726 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.977 | 0.692 | 0.931 | 0.968 | 0.941 | 0.671 |\n\nPage 1 of 15 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-15, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive\
