- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 88\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 65,683 / 270,000 used (24%)\n- Agent Age: 88 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 158**\n\nEvaluation '158' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'BRBG-Dual-CBKNN: ComBat PCA64 Embedding + Calibrated Balanced kNN on Residualized PCs (γ=0.74, k=48)' (ID: 158) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7189199764452483\n**ASW_batch:** 0.703\n**ASW_label:** 0.217\n**ARI:** 0.742\n**NMI:** 0.697\n**Graph_conn:** 0.966\n**kBET:** 0.678\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.289\n\
