    \n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/research_log.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Praxis Lineage Research Log (PC-weighting result)\n  EID 177 (PC-weighted residual graph): 0.7154\n    - ARI/NMI down (0.721/0.684) vs default (~0.742/0.697); mixing (ASW_batch/kBET/iLISI) ~unchanged.\n    - Conclusion: per-PC batch-R^2 weighting adds complexity without net gain.\n  Current defaults (frozen; best reproducible):\n    - Dual BRBG: Embedding = sc.pp.combat + PCA64 (HVGs); Graph = residualized PC50 (γ=0.74, l2=1e-3) + equal-quota balanced kNN (k=48, cosine, binary).\n    - Best stable scores: EIDs 156/147 ≈ 0.7190.\n  Next steps:\n    - Focus on consolidation and documentation (code package + archive appendix listing negatives: robust ComBat variants, graph PC56, PC-weighting).\n    - Optional future: revisit unsupervised γ/k heuristics with clearer stopping rules; otherwise maintain frozen defaults.\n```"
