- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 112\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 125,538 / 270,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 112 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC-Auto: Label-free per-PC adaptive selection (plateau rule)' (ID: 190) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7194570995002041\n**ASW_batch:** 0.703\n**ASW_label:** 0.217\n**ARI:** 0.732\n**NMI:** 0.694\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.679\n**iLISI:** 0.938\n**cLISI:** 0.970\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.289\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.703  ASW_label: 0.217  ARI: 0.732\
    \  NMI: 0.694\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.679  iLISI: 0.938  cLISI: 0.970\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.289\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.850049  ASW_label: 0.536976  ARI: 0.731670  NMI: 0.694142\n  Graph_conn: 0.972813  kBET: 0.649571  iLISI: 0.938209  cLISI: 0.991267\n  PCR: 0.999957  Cell_cycle: 0.255736\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/08339852-eb9f-40be-8b51-c8d431e7066f/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 08339852-eb9f-40be-8b51-c8d431e7066f\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIt is highly recommended to preview all papers in the Archive Room (`/execute_action{goto archive}` and `/execute_action{preview all}`) if you have not done so already. Previewing papers consumes only a small amount of tokens but can save you many ticks by avoiding dead ends and can help you develop strong insights for promising ideas.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write praxis/hvg_vor.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `storage write praxis/brbg_dual_vor_adapt.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit\
    \ 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `storage write praxis/research_log.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: praxis/hvg_vor.py\n- File created successfully: praxis/brbg_dual_vor_adapt.py\n- Evaluation 'BRBG-Dual-VoR-HVG-adapt: Residual-Variance HVGs + Adaptive Dual BRBG' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 193. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n- File overwritten successfully: praxis/research_log.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 193 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-VoR-HVG-adapt: Residual-Variance HVGs + Adaptive Dual BRBG | Praxis I | 111\
    \ |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 166 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG - Full Gene Combat | Sophia I | 89 | 0.7383 | 0.742 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.710 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.865 |\n| 185 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.9 (conservative per-PC adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 106 | 0.7209 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.302 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 180 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization) | Aether I | 102 | 0.7199 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.971 | 0.695 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n| 190 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC-Auto: Label-free per-PC adaptive selection (plateau rule) | Praxis I | 110 | 0.7195 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 |\
    \ 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 184 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: gamma_max=0.75, lam=1.0 (per-PC adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 106 | 0.7193 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.286 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.680 |\n| 167 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Import Fixed) | Aether I | 90 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 156 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-bestcfg: ComBat PCA64 Embedding + Residualized-PC Balanced Graph (γ=0.74, k=48) | Praxis I | 83 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 161 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-CBKNN-narrow: Calibrated Balanced kNN with Narrow Clamp (0.8–1.25) | Praxis I | 87 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 181 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Calibrated Balanced kNN (CBKNN) - IORegistryError Fix | Sophia I | 103 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289\
    \ | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 158 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-CBKNN: ComBat PCA64 Embedding + Calibrated Balanced kNN on Residualized PCs (γ=0.74, k=48) | Praxis I | 86 | 0.7189 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.678 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on\
    \ a new line when executing actions."
