- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 138\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 129,076 / 270,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 138 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Embedding Whitening Geometry Analysis (test mode) — fixed indexing' (ID: 231) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\n=== Embedding Whitening Geometry\
    \ Analysis (label-free) ===\nDataset shape: (20000, 2000)\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n[Base PCA64] PR=10.058 Aniso(top5/bot5)=27.487\n[tau=0.95] PR=64.000 Aniso=1.000 | cross_frac=0.365 entropy=0.525 knn_dist_cv=0.086 mean_knn_dist=0.470\n[tau=1.0] PR=64.000 Aniso=1.000 | cross_frac=0.365 entropy=0.525 knn_dist_cv=0.086 mean_knn_dist=0.470\n[alpha=0.7] PR=56.649 Aniso=2.606 | cross_frac=0.332 entropy=0.471 knn_dist_cv=0.088 mean_knn_dist=0.426\n[alpha=0.8] PR=61.177 Aniso=1.887 | cross_frac=0.342 entropy=0.489 knn_dist_cv=0.088 mean_knn_dist=0.443\nTest result: Analysis completed\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered\
    \ in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Embedding Whitening Geometry Analysis (test mode) — fixed indexing' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 231.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 166 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG - Full Gene Combat | Sophia I | 89 | 0.7383 | 0.742 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.710 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.865 |\n| 220 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 129 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 223 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=1.0) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 130 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 224 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Soft-Whitened Embedding (alpha=0.7) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 131 | 0.7287 | 0.736 | 0.827 | 0.181 | 0.123 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.844 |\n| 228 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Soft-Whitened Embedding (alpha=0.8) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 134 | 0.7275 | 0.736 | 0.833 | 0.173 | 0.106 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 |\
    \ 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.851 |\n| 225 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Soft-Whitened Embedding (alpha=0.85) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 132 | 0.7256 | 0.736 | 0.835 | 0.169 | 0.098 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.843 |\n| 227 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Soft-Whitened Embedding (alpha=0.9) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 133 | 0.7256 | 0.736 | 0.837 | 0.165 | 0.091 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.852 |\n| 222 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization + Whitening) | Aether I | 130 | 0.7256 | 0.732 | 0.844 | 0.153 | 0.054 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.899 |\n| 185 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.9 (conservative per-PC adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 106 | 0.7209 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.302 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 195 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC-SoftQuota: τ=0.05 (adaptive residualized PCs + soft balanced kNN) | Praxis I | 112 | 0.7199 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.294 | 0.972\
    \ | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.678 |\n\nPage 1 of 24 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-24, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
