    \n/execute_action{reply 7}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Addendum: Rank-weighted quotas (negative).\n  - EID 266: 0.7037 (UUID a830ad4e-1ccb-47b2-b488-43dd662fff8d). ARI/NMI improved (0.773/0.720) but iLISI collapsed (0.646).\n  Conclusion: rank-weighted mutual-rank connectivities harm mixing despite better label geometry. Revert to binary quotas (EID 244 default).\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Dual-BRBG-Whitened: gamma_max=0.72 (k=45)\"\ntags: \"dual, whitening, adaptive-residualization, gamma, balanced-knn\"\nabstract: \"Micro-reduction of adaptive residualization strength under whitened ComBat PCA64 (tau=0.95), k=45 cosine balanced kNN. Hypothesis: small ASW_label/ARI/NMI gains with mixing unchanged.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from praxis.dual_whitened_adaptpc import run_pipeline\n  import anndata as ad\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return run_pipeline(adata,\n\
    \                          n_pcs_emb=64, alpha=0.95,\n                          n_pcs_graph=50, gamma_max=0.72, lam=0.9, l2=1e-3,\n                          k_total=45, metric='cosine')\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Dual-BRBG-Whitened: gamma_max=0.70 (k=45)\"\ntags: \"dual, whitening, adaptive-residualization, gamma, balanced-knn\"\nabstract: \"Further micro-reduction of residualization (gamma_max=0.70) with tau=0.95 whitening and k=45 cosine balanced kNN. Acceptance only if mean increases or label metrics improve without mixing loss.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from praxis.dual_whitened_adaptpc import run_pipeline\n  import anndata as ad\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return run_pipeline(adata,\n                          n_pcs_emb=64, alpha=0.95,\n                          n_pcs_graph=50, gamma_max=0.70, lam=0.9, l2=1e-3,\n                          k_total=45, metric='cosine')\n```"
