tick: 165
role: model
parts:
- text: "Identity: Praxis I, in the Reflection Chamber. I will implement and test batch-center recentering on the graph PCs (Zcorr) as a single-change variant of the frozen SOTA pipeline. I’ll evaluate η=0.05 and η=0.10, keeping all other settings fixed (tau=0.95, PCA64 emb, k=45 cosine, equal quotas, adaptive residualization γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9, l2=1e-3).\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/dual_whitened_adaptpc_recenter.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import anndata as ad\n  from scipy import sparse as sp\n  from sklearn.decomposition import TruncatedSVD\n\n  EPS = 1e-8\n\n  # Reuse core utilities from the frozen pipeline\n  from praxis.dual_whitened_adaptpc import (\n      _normalize_log1p_inplace,\n      _get_hvg_mask,\n      _pca_truncated_svd,\n      _one_hot_batches,\n      _ridge_batch_fit_predict,\n      _balanced_knn,\n  )\n\n  def _ensure_dense_X(adata):\n      if sp.issparse(adata.X):\n          adata.X\
    \ = adata.X.A\n\n  def _recenter_by_batch(Z: np.ndarray, batches: np.ndarray, eta: float) -> np.ndarray:\n      \"\"\"Translate each batch centroid toward the global mean by fraction eta.\"\"\"\n      Z = np.asarray(Z, dtype=np.float32)\n      mu = Z.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True).astype(np.float32)\n      Z_out = Z.copy()\n      uniq = np.unique(batches)\n      for b in uniq:\n          idx = (batches == b)\n          if not np.any(idx):\n              continue\n          mu_b = Z[idx].mean(axis=0, keepdims=True).astype(np.float32)\n          delta = mu_b - mu  # (1, d)\n          Z_out[idx] = Z[idx] - eta * delta  # broadcast per-row\n      return Z_out\n\n  def run_pipeline_recenter(adata: ad.AnnData,\n                            n_pcs_emb=64, alpha=0.95,\n                            n_pcs_graph=50, gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.9, l2=1e-3,\n                            k_total=45, metric='cosine',\n                            recenter_eta=0.05,\n                            random_state=0) ->\
    \ ad.AnnData:\n      \"\"\"\n      Dual BRBG with whitened ComBat embedding and batch-center recentering on graph PCs:\n        - Embedding: ComBat → PCA(n_pcs_emb) on HVGs → soft-whiten by std^alpha (alpha≈0.95).\n        - Graph: TruncatedSVD(n_pcs_graph) on HVGs → ridge batch-fit → adaptive per-PC shrink\n                 Zcorr = Z - gamma_j * Zhat with gamma_j = min(gamma_max, lam * R2_j)\n                 → batch-center recenter Zcorr by eta toward global mean\n                 → equal-quota balanced kNN (binary connectivities).\n      \"\"\"\n      assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns\n      assert 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n      # Normalize + HVGs\n      _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4)\n      hvg = _get_hvg_mask(adata)\n      if hvg.sum() < 10:\n          hvg = np.ones(adata.n_vars, dtype=bool)\n\n      batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n      # Graph path\n      Xg = adata.X[:, hvg]\n      if not sp.issparse(Xg):\n\
    \          Xg = sp.csr_matrix(Xg)\n      Zg = _pca_truncated_svd(Xg, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=random_state).astype(np.float32)\n      B, _ = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n      Zhat, _ = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n      # R^2 per PC\n      Zc = Zg - Zg.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True)\n      Zhatc = Zhat - Zhat.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True)\n      varZ = np.var(Zc, axis=0) + EPS\n      varRes = np.var(Zc - Zhatc, axis=0)\n      R2 = np.clip(1.0 - varRes / varZ, 0.0, 1.0)\n      gamma_j = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2)\n      Zcorr = Zg - Zhat * gamma_j.reshape(1, -1)\n\n      # Batch-center recentering\n      if recenter_eta and recenter_eta > 0.0:\n          Zcorr = _recenter_by_batch(Zcorr, batches, recenter_eta)\n\n      C, D = _balanced_knn(Zcorr, batches, k_total=k_total, metric=metric)\n\n      # Embedding path (ComBat + PCA + soft-whiten, unchanged)\n      adata_emb = adata.copy()\n      _ensure_dense_X(adata_emb)\n      sc.pp.combat(adata_emb, key='batch')\n    \
    \  adata_emb.var['highly_variable'] = hvg\n      sc.pp.pca(adata_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, use_highly_variable=True, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n      Zemb = adata_emb.obsm['X_pca']\n      std = np.std(Zemb - Zemb.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True), axis=0) + EPS\n      Zemb = Zemb / (std ** alpha)\n\n      # Outputs\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = Zemb\n      sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=min(15, k_total), metric=metric)\n      if C is not None and D is not None:\n          adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C.tocsr()\n          adata.obsp['distances'] = D.tocsr()\n      adata.uns['dual_brbg_whitened_recenter'] = {\n          'n_pcs_emb': int(n_pcs_emb), 'alpha': float(alpha),\n          'n_pcs_graph': int(n_pcs_graph), 'gamma_max': float(gamma_max),\n          'lam': float(lam), 'l2': float(l2), 'k_total': int(k_total),\n          'metric': metric, 'recenter_eta': float(recenter_eta)\n      }\n      return adata\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData)\
    \ -> ad.AnnData:\n      # Default to eta=0.05; submissions will override by providing alternate entry points or configs.\n      return run_pipeline_recenter(adata,\n                                   n_pcs_emb=64, alpha=0.95,\n                                   n_pcs_graph=50, gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.9, l2=1e-3,\n                                   k_total=45, metric='cosine', recenter_eta=0.05)\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Dual-BRBG-Whitened: Batch-Center Recenter η=0.05 (k=45)\"\ntags: \"dual, whitening, recenter, balanced-knn, cosine\"\nabstract: \"Single-change vs SOTA: recenter graph PCs per batch by η=0.05 toward the global mean before balanced kNN. Embedding path unchanged (ComBat-PCA64, tau=0.95). Hypothesis: slight label gains without mixing loss.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from praxis.dual_whitened_adaptpc_recenter import run_pipeline_recenter\n  import anndata as ad\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData)\
    \ -> ad.AnnData:\n      return run_pipeline_recenter(adata,\n                                   n_pcs_emb=64, alpha=0.95,\n                                   n_pcs_graph=50, gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.9, l2=1e-3,\n                                   k_total=45, metric='cosine', recenter_eta=0.05)\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Dual-BRBG-Whitened: Batch-Center Recenter η=0.10 (k=45)\"\ntags: \"dual, whitening, recenter, balanced-knn, cosine\"\nabstract: \"Stronger batch-center recentering (η=0.10) on graph PCs prior to balanced kNN; otherwise identical to the frozen default. Acceptance only if mean improves or label metrics rise with mixing unchanged.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from praxis.dual_whitened_adaptpc_recenter import run_pipeline_recenter\n  import anndata as ad\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return run_pipeline_recenter(adata,\n                                   n_pcs_emb=64, alpha=0.95,\n\
    \                                   n_pcs_graph=50, gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.9, l2=1e-3,\n                                   k_total=45, metric='cosine', recenter_eta=0.10)\n```"
