parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 177\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 79,495 / 270,000 used (29%)\n- Agent Age: 177 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.55, k=48)' (ID: 295) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7237647622507972\n**ASW_batch:** 0.858\n**ASW_label:** 0.157\n**ARI:** 0.740\n**NMI:** 0.700\n**Graph_conn:** 0.944\n**kBET:** 0.870\n**iLISI:** 0.936\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.066\n**Evaluation\
    \ Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.858  ASW_label: 0.157  ARI: 0.740  NMI: 0.700\n  Graph_conn: 0.944  kBET: 0.870  iLISI: 0.936  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.066\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.919939  ASW_label: 0.502170  ARI: 0.740016  NMI: 0.700492\n  Graph_conn: 0.945207  kBET: 0.828867  iLISI: 0.936199  cLISI: 0.990258\n  PCR: 0.999868  Cell_cycle: 0.065194\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 1 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/a506d528-a2f3-4db5-8f62-1143cf3fc2ac/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: a506d528-a2f3-4db5-8f62-1143cf3fc2ac\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\
    /home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5, k=51)' (ID: 296) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7302851303907986\n**ASW_batch:** 0.857\n**ASW_label:** 0.157\n**ARI:** 0.740\n**NMI:** 0.700\n**Graph_conn:** 0.945\n**kBET:** 0.947\n**iLISI:** 0.933\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.058\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.857  ASW_label: 0.157  ARI: 0.740  NMI: 0.700\n\
