- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 182\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 92,796 / 270,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 182 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Dual BRBG: PBVE Auto-Gated PCs (τ=80th) + Balanced kNN (k=48)' (ID: 308) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7254505817968673\n**ASW_batch:** 0.847\n**ASW_label:** 0.156\n**ARI:** 0.740\n**NMI:** 0.701\n**Graph_conn:** 0.944\n**kBET:** 0.899\n**iLISI:** 0.936\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.064\n**Evaluation Details:**\
    \ Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.847  ASW_label: 0.156  ARI: 0.740  NMI: 0.701\n  Graph_conn: 0.944  kBET: 0.899  iLISI: 0.936  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.064\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.914958  ASW_label: 0.501764  ARI: 0.740313  NMI: 0.701210\n  Graph_conn: 0.945207  kBET: 0.856543  iLISI: 0.936199  cLISI: 0.990258\n  PCR: 0.999865  Cell_cycle: 0.063624\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 1 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/968147cb-ad94-4934-adcc-cd5648b3531b/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 968147cb-ad94-4934-adcc-cd5648b3531b\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Dual BRBG: PBVE 0.5 + Cluster-Bridge Graph Augmentation (k=48)' (ID: 307) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7309093068127026\n**ASW_batch:** 0.857\n**ASW_label:** 0.157\n**ARI:** 0.741\n**NMI:** 0.701\n**Graph_conn:** 0.944\n**kBET:** 0.947\n**iLISI:** 0.936\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.060\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.857  ASW_label: 0.157  ARI: 0.741  NMI: 0.701\n  Graph_conn: 0.944  kBET: 0.947  iLISI: 0.936  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.060\n\nRaw Scores (before\
    \ normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.919520  ASW_label: 0.502174  ARI: 0.740583  NMI: 0.700967\n  Graph_conn: 0.945207  kBET: 0.901008  iLISI: 0.936199  cLISI: 0.990228\n  PCR: 0.999867  Cell_cycle: 0.060650\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 1 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/28cd2001-6a67-4516-8557-0b6e5833c740/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 28cd2001-6a67-4516-8557-0b6e5833c740\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Reflection Chamber);\n2. `storage write praxis/dual_brbg_whiten_pbve_clusterbridge_k48.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `storage write praxis/dual_brbg_whiten_pbve_autogate_k48.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n6. `storage write praxis/research_log.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: praxis/dual_brbg_whiten_pbve_clusterbridge_k48.py\n- Evaluation 'Dual BRBG: PBVE 0.5 + Cluster-Bridge Graph\
    \ Augmentation (k=48)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 307.\n- File created successfully: praxis/dual_brbg_whiten_pbve_autogate_k48.py\n- Evaluation 'Dual BRBG: PBVE Auto-Gated PCs (τ=80th) + Balanced kNN (k=48)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 308.\n- File overwritten successfully: praxis/research_log.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 166 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG\
    \ - Full Gene Combat | Sophia I | 89 | 0.7383 | 0.742 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.710 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.865 |\n| 289 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5, k=48) | Praxis I | 173 | 0.7314 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.063 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.949 |\n| 307 | 1 | Dual BRBG: PBVE 0.5 + Cluster-Bridge Graph Augmentation (k=48) | Praxis I | 181 | 0.7309 | 0.741 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.060 | 0.944 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.936 | 0.947 |\n| 287 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Global Soft-Whiten + Per-Batch Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5) | Praxis I | 171 | 0.7303 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.054 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.948 |\n| 296 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5, k=51) | Praxis I | 176 | 0.7303 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.058 | 0.945 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.947 |\n| 244 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph (k=45, cosine) | Praxis\
    \ I | 144 | 0.7296 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.083 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 256 | 1 | Logos II: Replication of Praxis I's SOTA (ID 220) | Logos II | 154 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 220 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 129 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 223 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=1.0) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 130 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 291 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication Attempt: Dual BRBG (Soft-Whitened Emb) | Aether II | 174 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n\nPage 1 of 31 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-31, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort\
    \ order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
