  I’m thinking that right now, we don’t need to take heavy actions except maybe to hold off on more submissions until the current runs are complete. We could sort the page by rank score to review the top results, but it’s not necessary. I believe a good step would be to implement an ''auto_local_scale'' selection, choosing r as round(sqrt(k_total)). However, I’ll wait for the results before making any big changes.


  Next, I plan to create a log file to summarize the methods, expected effects, pending EIDs, and follow-up plans.'
