- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 190\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 67,564 / 270,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 190 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Dual BRBG + SBT-Graph: Sliced Batch Transport on Graph PCs (n=32, eta=0.15)' (ID: 329) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7207770963242299\n**ASW_batch:** 0.852\n**ASW_label:** 0.161\n**ARI:** 0.744\n**NMI:** 0.704\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.818\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.081\n**Evaluation\
