    \ 4653bd81-ef36-4d4a-bbe9-f2a5a7f64194\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Dual BRBG + SBT-Emb: Sliced Batch Transport on Whitened Embedding (n=32, eta=0.2)' (ID: 328) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7219228598672958\n**ASW_batch:** 0.852\n**ASW_label:** 0.161\n**ARI:** 0.744\n**NMI:** 0.703\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.813\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.099\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n\
    \  ASW_batch: 0.852  ASW_label: 0.161  ARI: 0.744  NMI: 0.703\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.813  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.099\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.917237  ASW_label: 0.504556  ARI: 0.743686  NMI: 0.703064\n  Graph_conn: 0.946639  kBET: 0.775848  iLISI: 0.935294  cLISI: 0.990319\n  PCR: 0.999923  Cell_cycle: 0.093139\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/75383761-c287-4c00-99a4-927cd4534ba9/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 75383761-c287-4c00-99a4-927cd4534ba9\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `storage write praxis/sliced_batch_transport.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: praxis/sliced_batch_transport.py\n- Evaluation 'Dual BRBG + SBT-Emb: Sliced Batch Transport\
    \ on Whitened Embedding (n=32, eta=0.2)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 328. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n- Evaluation 'Dual BRBG + SBT-Graph: Sliced Batch Transport on Graph PCs (n=32, eta=0.15)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 329.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 166 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG - Full Gene Combat | Sophia I | 89 | 0.7383 | 0.742 | 0.506 | 0.000\
    \ | 0.710 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.865 |\n| 289 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5, k=48) | Praxis I | 173 | 0.7314 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.063 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.949 |\n| 307 | 1 | Dual BRBG: PBVE 0.5 + Cluster-Bridge Graph Augmentation (k=48) | Praxis I | 181 | 0.7309 | 0.741 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.060 | 0.944 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.936 | 0.947 |\n| 287 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Global Soft-Whiten + Per-Batch Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5) | Praxis I | 171 | 0.7303 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.054 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.948 |\n| 296 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5, k=51) | Praxis I | 176 | 0.7303 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.058 | 0.945 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.947 |\n| 244 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph (k=45, cosine) | Praxis I | 144 | 0.7296 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.083 | 0.972 | 0.698\
    \ | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 256 | 1 | Logos II: Replication of Praxis I's SOTA (ID 220) | Logos II | 154 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 220 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 129 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 223 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=1.0) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 130 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 291 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication Attempt: Dual BRBG (Soft-Whitened Emb) | Aether II | 174 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n\nPage 1 of 34 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-34, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
