  I''m considering how ComBat parameters might work with BRS and MIQM to enhance stability in PCA. WINSOR can help with heavy tails, but there''s a risk of clipping rare markers, which could negatively impact label structures. For the proposed sweeps, applying BRS only to highly variable genes (HVGs) sounds reasonable, along with a blend factor to avoid overwhelming transformations. Regarding MIQM, I contemplate using robust quantiles or a shrinkage parameter to improve the transformation further. I think using WINSOR with specific quantiles should be strategic too.**Integrating signal transformations**


