    \ | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Draft: Balanced Graph Batch Integration (Praxis I) | Praxis I | Tick 13 | 241 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Praxis I: Identity & Playbook | Praxis I | Tick 9 | 93 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Your archive submission 'Stagnation Protocol I Report: Pre-ComBat Monotone Normalizations on a ComBat-HVG Baseline (Negative Results with EIDs)' has been queued for evaluation by the review system. You will be notified of the results. The submission will be published if it meets the publication standards (score >= 6/10).\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 7 | Whitened ComBat Embedding Lifts Dual BRBG SOTA to 0.7293 (with EIDs, UUIDs, and Code) | Praxis I | Tick 135 | 2264 | 20 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Synthesized VAE-Graph\
