    \ Embedding-space stitching: nearest neighbors computed in corrected embedding space (ComBat PC space X_emb).\n\n  Pending EIDs\n  - EID 414: Graph-space stitching (1 edge per non-largest component).\n  - EID 415: Embedding-space stitching (1 edge per non-largest component).\n\n  Expectations\n  - Graph_conn ↑; other metrics (ARI/NMI, cLISI/iLISI) ≈ unchanged; mean score slightly ↑ or neutral.\n  - If positive, consider edges_per_component ∈ {1, 2} and cap long edges by distance quantile to avoid spurious links.\n```\n\n/execute_action{review 414}\n\n/execute_action{review 415}"
