  I''m thinking about the risk that Graph_conn might not improve since it measures label connectivity within cell-type clusters. The replacements involve cross-batch edges, which may not align with the same label. To mitigate this, I propose requiring candidate j'' to share an unsupervised cluster with i, using Leiden clusters. This strategy aims to encourage edges within the same cell type but without labels. However, there''s a risk of cluster mismatch, which could be beneficial in some cases. I''ll evaluate this with specific run conditions.'
