    Abstract: This experiment tests a novel idea: Integrating Neighborhood Context into Combat. Prior to the Combat batch correction, gene expression values are smoothed by averaging across a cell''s 15 nearest neighbors (including itself) in a pre-computed kNN graph. This aims to reduce noise and provide more biologically coherent input to Combat, potentially improving performance over the manual Combat baseline.

