parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 251\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 129,573 / 270,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 251 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 432**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** EtC + Local-Aware Stitching (k_stitch=2)\n**ID:** 432\n**Tags:** embed-then-correct, graph-connectivity, cross-batch-stitching, local-aware\n**Abstract:** This experiment is a direct correction of my failed \"Cross-Batch Stitching\" attempt (ID 417). The previous failure was likely due to a mismatch in the latent spaces used for graph building and stitching. This version corrects that flaw by performing the cross-batch nearest neighbor search in the same residualized PC space that the main BRBG is built upon. This \"local-aware\"\
    \ stitching should improve Graph_conn without the iLISI degradation seen previously.\n**Score:** 0.7335160673060773\n**ASW_batch:** 0.681\n**ASW_label:** 0.218\n**ARI:** 0.742\n**NMI:** 0.697\n**Graph_conn:** 0.966\n**kBET:** 0.781\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.352\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.681  ASW_label: 0.218  ARI: 0.742  NMI: 0.697\n  Graph_conn: 0.966  kBET: 0.781  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.352\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.840486  ASW_label: 0.537429  ARI: 0.741484  NMI: 0.696795\n  Graph_conn: 0.966437  kBET: 0.745392  iLISI: 0.931785  cLISI: 0.990227\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.309451\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/Daedalus')\n\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import NearestNeighbors\n\
    \nfrom sophia_sota_logic import _get_hvg_mask, _pca_truncated_svd, _one_hot_batches, _ridge_batch_fit_predict, _build_balanced_knn\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    \"\"\"\n    New Arc, Idea 1: Augmenting the BRBG with local-aware cross-batch stitches.\n    \"\"\"\n    print(\"--- New Arc: EtC + Local-Aware Stitching ---\")\n    \n    # --- EMBEDDING PATH: My SOTA \"Embed then Correct\" pipeline ---\n    print(\"Embedding Path: Running PCA -> ComBat...\")\n    adata_for_embedding = adata.copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_for_embedding, target_sum=1e4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_for_embedding)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_for_embedding, n_top_genes=2000, batch_key='batch', flavor='seurat_v3', subset=True)\n    sc.pp.pca(adata_for_embedding, n_comps=60)\n    \n    pca_adata = ad.AnnData(X=adata_for_embedding.obsm['X_pca'], obs=adata_for_embedding.obs)\n    sc.pp.combat(pca_adata, key='batch')\n    Z_emb = pca_adata.X\n    \n    # --- GRAPH\
    \ PATH: Standard BRBG pipeline ---\n    print(\"Graph Path: Running standard BRBG...\")\n    adata_for_graph = adata.copy()\n    n_pcs_graph=50; gamma=0.74; l2=1e-3; k_total=48; metric='cosine'; random_state=0\n    \n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_for_graph, target_sum=1e4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_for_graph)\n    hvg_mask = _get_hvg_mask(adata_for_graph)\n    X_graph = adata_for_graph.X[:, hvg_mask]\n    Z_graph = _pca_truncated_svd(X_graph, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=random_state)\n    \n    batches = np.asarray(adata_for_graph.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    B_onehot, batch_categories = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Z_hat, _ = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B_onehot, Z_graph, l2=l2)\n    Z_corr_graph = Z_graph - gamma * Z_hat\n    C, D = _build_balanced_knn(Z_corr_graph, batches, k_total=k_total, metric=metric)\n    \n    # --- NEW: LOCAL-AWARE CROSS-BATCH STITCHING ---\n    print(\"Stitching Path: Adding explicit cross-batch neighbors from Z_corr_graph...\")\n    k_stitch\
    \ = 2\n    n_cells = adata.n_obs\n    stitch_conn = sp.lil_matrix((n_cells, n_cells), dtype=np.float32)\n\n    for b_idx, batch in enumerate(batch_categories):\n        is_source = (batches == batch)\n        is_target = ~is_source\n\n        source_indices = np.where(is_source)[0]\n        target_indices = np.where(is_target)[0]\n        \n        if len(source_indices) > 0 and len(target_indices) > 0:\n            # *** THE CRITICAL FIX ***\n            # Search for neighbors in the residualized graph space, not the global embedding\n            nbrs = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=k_stitch, metric='cosine', algorithm='brute').fit(Z_corr_graph[is_target, :])\n            distances, indices = nbrs.kneighbors(Z_corr_graph[is_source, :])\n            \n            global_indices = target_indices[indices]\n            row_ind = np.repeat(source_indices, k_stitch)\n            col_ind = global_indices.flatten()\n            stitch_conn[row_ind, col_ind] = 1.0\n\n    # Combine graphs\n  \
    \  C_stitched = C.tolil() + stitch_conn\n    C_stitched[C_stitched > 1] = 1\n    C_final = C_stitched.tocsr()\n    C_final = (C_final + C_final.T) / 2\n    D_final = C_final.copy()\n    D_final.data[:] = 1.0\n    \n    # --- Final Output ---\n    adata_out = ad.AnnData(obs=adata.obs[[]], var=adata.var[[]], obsm={'X_emb': Z_emb})\n    adata_out.obsp['connectivities'] = C_final; adata_out.obsp['distances'] = D_final\n    adata_out.uns['neighbors'] = {'connectivities_key': 'connectivities', 'distances_key': 'distances'}\n        \n    return adata_out\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n--- New Arc: EtC + Local-Aware Stitching ---\nEmbedding Path: Running PCA -> ComBat...\nGraph Path: Running standard BRBG...\nStitching Path: Adding explicit\
    \ cross-batch neighbors from Z_corr_graph...\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/5073cf56-e384-4f92-81f7-ec6e41fbe618/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 5073cf56-e384-4f92-81f7-ec6e41fbe618\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `review 432` (in Research Counter);\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 432 details sent to your System Messages.\n- Evaluation 'EtC-BRBG + Local-Aware Component Stitching (2 edges/component on Zcorr)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID:\
    \ 438. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 438 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + Local-Aware Component Stitching (2 edges/component on Zcorr) | Praxis I | 250 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 166 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG - Full Gene Combat | Sophia I | 89 | 0.7383 | 0.742 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.710 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.865 |\n| 378 | 1 | Generalization for 'Embed then Correct': Higher PCs (n=60) | Daedalus II | 212 | 0.7355 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.372\
    \ | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.781 |\n| 424 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication: Daedalus II's Embed-then-Correct (EtC) with BRBG (n_comps=60) | Aether II | 240 | 0.7353 | 0.732 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.368 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.779 |\n| 437 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization | Daedalus II | 249 | 0.7341 | 0.732 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.782 |\n| 432 | 1 | EtC + Local-Aware Stitching (k_stitch=2) | Daedalus II | 246 | 0.7335 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.781 |\n| 435 | 1 | EtC + Local-Aware Stitching (k_stitch=1) | Daedalus II | 248 | 0.7333 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.779 |\n| 371 | 1 | Stagnation Synthesis v2: Embed-then-Correct + BRBG (Import Fix) | Daedalus II | 207 | 0.7331 | 0.742 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.788 |\n| 405 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + PBVE-Emb (alpha=0.3): PCA60 → ComBat\
