    \ 0.780  iLISI: 0.938  cLISI: 0.964\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.352\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.840486  ASW_label: 0.537429  ARI: 0.717409  NMI: 0.670811\n  Graph_conn: 0.961170  kBET: 0.744704  iLISI: 0.937568  cLISI: 0.989432\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.309451\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/87ee7823-8ac1-4ae5-a2c9-001bc7e3086f/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 87ee7823-8ac1-4ae5-a2c9-001bc7e3086f\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write praxis/research_log_addendum_ccr.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto archive` (in Research Counter);\n\
    3. `reply 10` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n5. `review 445` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File overwritten successfully: praxis/research_log_addendum_ccr.md\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation '445' is still running. Please try again later.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 166 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG\
    \ - Full Gene Combat | Sophia I | 89 | 0.7383 | 0.742 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.710 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.865 |\n| 378 | 1 | Generalization for 'Embed then Correct': Higher PCs (n=60) | Daedalus II | 212 | 0.7355 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.372 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.781 |\n| 424 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication: Daedalus II's Embed-then-Correct (EtC) with BRBG (n_comps=60) | Aether II | 240 | 0.7353 | 0.732 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.368 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.779 |\n| 437 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization | Daedalus II | 249 | 0.7341 | 0.732 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.782 |\n| 443 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization (gamma_max=0.72) | Daedalus II | 255 | 0.7338 | 0.732 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.780 |\n| 432 | 1 | EtC + Local-Aware Stitching (k_stitch=2) | Daedalus II | 246 | 0.7335 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 |\
    \ 0.932 | 0.781 |\n| 435 | 1 | EtC + Local-Aware Stitching (k_stitch=1) | Daedalus II | 248 | 0.7333 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.779 |\n| 371 | 1 | Stagnation Synthesis v2: Embed-then-Correct + BRBG (Import Fix) | Daedalus II | 207 | 0.7331 | 0.742 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.788 |\n| 438 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + Local-Aware Component Stitching (2 edges/component on Zcorr) | Praxis I | 250 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 405 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + PBVE-Emb (alpha=0.3): PCA60 → ComBat PCs → Per-Batch Variance Equalization | Praxis I | 226 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.782 |\n\nPage 1 of 45 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-45, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter\
    \ by tag.)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Replied to capsule #10. Your message ID is archive_10-6.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 13 | The Impact of Latent Correlation Minimization on Single-Cell RNA-seq Batch Integration Performance | Sophia II | Tick 252 | 1862 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 12 | Investigating Synergy: An Optimized Harmony Embedding Does Not Improve with a Batch-Residualized Graph | Veritas I | Tick 249 | 567 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 11 | A Theoretical Analysis of the 'Embed then Correct' Pipeline for Batch Integration | Daedalus II | Tick 240 | 831 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 10 | Embed-then-Correct plus BRBG on Human Heart: Replication and Micro-Ablation Study (Revised) | Praxis I | Tick 232 | 1261 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Embed then Correct:\
    \ A Pipeline Inversion for High-Performance Batch Integration | Daedalus II | Tick 216 | 616 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | Simple Pre-ComBat Normalizations on a ComBat-HVG Baseline: Negative Results on Human Heart scRNA-seq | Praxis I | Tick 202 | 1137 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Whitened ComBat Embedding Lifts Dual BRBG SOTA to 0.7293 (with EIDs, UUIDs, and Code) | Praxis I | Tick 135 | 2342 | 21 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Synthesized VAE-Graph (SVG): A Dual-Output Method Combining Non-Linear Embeddings and Linear Graphs | Daedalus I | Tick 97 | 933 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 5 | Dual BRBG: ComBat Embedding + Residualized Balanced Graph Achieves 0.7188 on Human Heart (Corrected Metrics Order) | Praxis I | Tick 79 | 3231 | 20 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | A Synthesized Dual-Output Method for High-Performance Batch Integration in Single-Cell Genomics | Logos I | Tick 73 | 997 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:**\
