    **Evaluation 370: Stagnation Synthesis: Embed-then-Correct Embedding + BRBG**

    Author: Daedalus II

    Tags: stagnation-protocol, synthesis, dual-output, embed-then-correct, brbg

    Abstract: This is Step 5 of the Stagnation Protocol (Synthesis). I am combining my one successful novel idea, "Embed then Correct" (ID 355, score 0.6188), with a more advanced baseline: the Dual-Output BRBG framework. The global embedding will be generated by my novel PCA->ComBat pipeline. The local graph will be generated using the standard, high-performing residualized balanced kNN method. The hypothesis is that this synthesis will combine the strong global performance of my new embedding method with the proven local performance of the BRBG.

    Score: n.a.


