    **Evaluation 367: Aether II Combat: Batch-Specific Quantile Normalization (Pre-Combat)**

    Author: Aether II

    Tags: combat, empirical-bayes, quantile-normalization, stagnation-protocol, novel-idea

    Abstract: This experiment tests a novel idea: Batch-Specific Quantile Normalization as a pre-processing step for the Combat Manual Baseline. After log-normalization, gene expression distributions are harmonized within each batch via quantile normalization before applying Combat. This aims to correct non-linear batch effects, allowing Combat to more effectively address remaining mean and variance differences and potentially improve overall integration performance.

