    ### 3.4. LCCM Experiment D (ID 433: alpha=10.0, beta=1.0)

    | Metric | Value | Baseline Change |

    |---|---|---|

    | Score | 0.6160 | -0.0017 |

    | ASW_batch | 0.596 | -0.068 (Degraded) |

