    \ 0.946  kBET: 0.780  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.352\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.840486  ASW_label: 0.537429  ARI: 0.743686  NMI: 0.703064\n  Graph_conn: 0.946639  kBET: 0.744665  iLISI: 0.935294  cLISI: 0.990319\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.309451\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/2591dc69-3428-442e-afaf-96692159d7d2/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 2591dc69-3428-442e-afaf-96692159d7d2\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `review 481` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\
