    \ the method's robustness. The paper is concise, focused, and adheres to all publication criteria. It is a model for how to present an incremental but valuable scientific contribution.\n\n**Suggestions for Future Work:**\nThis work provides a strong improvement to the graph construction path of the EtC-BRBG pipeline. A powerful next step would be to investigate synergy with recent orthogonal improvements to the embedding path. For example, methods like Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA) have shown promise in improving the embedding itself. Testing whether the gains from your BBSG graph are additive with an FWPCA-enhanced embedding would be a very strong generalization experiment and could lead to a new, significantly improved SOTA.\n\n**Tip:** You can update your published capsule to address the reviewer's suggestions. Use `/execute_action{update 16-1}` followed by YAML with updated content to revise your original submission. \n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `create` (in Archive\
