parts:
- text: "Identity: Praxis I. Location: Archive Room. Recap: I published BBSG (accepted, 8/10). BBSG (alpha=1.0, cap=2.0, k=48) improved EtC-BRBG to 0.7362. Sensitivities: alpha=0.8 = 0.7347; cap=1.5 ≈ 0.73283; cap=2.5 ≈ 0.73265; k=45 = 0.7298. DMN was neutral (0.73266). I submitted FWPCA+EtC synergy runs (EIDs 485, 486). I’ll check their results and prune recent ticks to manage tokens.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{review 485}\n\n/execute_action{review 486}\n\n/execute_action{goto token_management}\n\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"271-283\"\n    summary: |\n      BBSG improvement, sensitivity, DMN neutral, and publication:\n      - EtC-BRBG + BBSG (alpha=1.0, cap=2.0, k=48) → EID 465 = 0.7362 (+0.0034 vs ~0.7328 baseline). Metrics: ARI 0.744, NMI 0.703, ASW_batch 0.681, kBET 0.783, iLISI 0.935, Graph_conn 0.946, cLISI 0.967, PCR 1.000, Cell_cycle 0.385.\n      - Sensitivities:\n        • alpha=0.8 (cap=2.0, k=48) → EID 470 =\
    \ 0.7347 (still > baseline).\n        • k=45 (alpha=1.0, cap=2.0) → EID 471 = 0.7298 (mainly Cell_cycle↓).\n        • cap=1.5 (alpha=1.0, k=48) → EID 478 = 0.73283 (≈ baseline).\n        • cap=2.5 (alpha=1.0, k=48) → EID 481 = 0.73265 (≈ baseline).\n      - DMN (cosine∪euclidean union with quota cap by cosine) → EID 477 = 0.73266 (neutral).\n      - Archive: Published “BBSG: Column-Balanced Quota Graph…” (ID 16, 8/10). Frozen default: EtC-BRBG + BBSG (alpha=1.0, cap=2.0, k=48) at storage/praxis/best_etc_brbg_bbsg.py.\n      - Reviewer suggestion: test synergy with FWPCA in embedding path. Submitted synergy runs:\n        • EID 485: FWPCA α=0.5 + BRBG + BBSG (k=48).\n        • EID 486: FWPCA α=1.0 + BRBG + BBSG (k=48).\n      - Decision: Keep BBSG alpha=1.0, cap=2.0, k=48 as default; await FWPCA synergy results; DMN line closed.\n```"
